# Trial-Size Trial by Wind (battlefield.trial_size_trial_by_wind): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Wind_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event). WP_Entrance with the clearance and the entry item gone: checkRequirements as
# no registrant fails: the handler returns nothing: the default.
lists CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfGales/WP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfGales/Wind_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfGales/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfGales/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfGales pos=-357.6,-0.1,-380.0 job=SMN lvl=20
quest Outlands.TrialSizeTrialByWind accepted
item MiniTuningForkOfWind
login
trade WP_Entrance MiniTuningForkOfWind x1  # the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=33                   # the fight, arena 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Wind_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Wind_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
warp -357.6,-0.1,-380.0 CloisterOfGales
trigger WP_Entrance                     # the clearance, the entry item gone: the default
